WEBVTT

00:19:28.913 --> 00:19:33.454
Because even though my mom provided for
us to the best of her abilities,

00:19:33.871 --> 00:19:38.829
you know, I wanted things like brand
name shoes or Levi jeans,

00:19:38.829 --> 00:19:41.746
like we would go to Kmart and at
the beginning the school year,

00:19:41.746 --> 00:19:44.038
and we'd each get like a certain
amount of money we could spend.

00:19:44.038 --> 00:19:45.954
And then that was it. And I
was like, I don't want to,

00:19:45.954 --> 00:19:47.704
but I want to wear the brands, you know?

00:19:47.829 --> 00:19:49.663
And my mom would say, I can't afford it.

00:19:49.954 --> 00:19:52.538
So as soon as I could, you know,
I babysat before that.

00:19:52.538 --> 00:19:56.538
But but honestly, as soon as I could,
I got myself a job and

00:19:58.204 --> 00:20:01.079
I was like thirteen and a half.
I sort of fudged my age.